                                "sense_id": "f36af859-4a09-39a6-9b7f-448d344163ce",
                                "text": "I also have a WWW page with pictures if interested: […] look under the Convention '95 page, there are several streptos. Also look under \"Take a bite of the strang stuff\" for a view of a^([sic]) unifoliate strep."
                            },
                            {
