                                "sense_id": "f36af859-4a09-39a6-9b7f-448d344163ce",
                                "text": "On my arrival at the nursery which (like so many of its kind) is tucked in the back of beyond, Rex was anxious to show me his beloved ‘streps’ (Streptocarpus) and seemed almost disappointed that I should insist instead on viewing his ‘chiris’ (Chirita)."
